# ⚡ Study Notes Hub (Bitcoin DeFi Edition)

A high-performance, decentralized-style local knowledge dashboard built with **Streamlit**. This app automatically syncs, manages, and renders instructor notes from GitHub using a cutting-edge "Bitcoin DeFi" aesthetic (True Void backgrounds, glowing orange gradients, and glass morphism).

## 🚀 Core Features

* **🔴 Live Network Sync:** Automatically pings the remote GitHub repository. If a new commit is detected, a dynamic red dot indicator alerts you to sync the network state.
* **🛡️ Local Containment:** Safely clones and maintains study materials in a localized `instructor_notes` directory without polluting your root folder.
* **🧠 3-Tab God-Tier Viewer:**
  * **📖 Document Render:** Beautifully parses Markdown, Python, JS, and C++ files natively.
  * **🤖 AI Logic Extraction:** Automatically scans files for core structures (`def`, `class`) and Markdown headers to generate instant architectural summaries.
  * **📌 Encrypted Side-Notes:** A localized text area to save private study parameters and memorandums for any specific file.
* **🌌 Bitcoin DeFi UI:** Completely overhauled frontend utilizing CSS injection for pill-shaped gradient buttons, glowing borders, custom typography (*Space Grotesk & JetBrains Mono*), and a deep space cryptographic vibe.

## 🛠️ Prerequisites

Before initializing the node, ensure you have the following installed on your machine:
* [Python 3.8+](https://www.python.org/downloads/)
* [Git](https://git-scm.com/downloads)

## ⚙️ Installation & Setup

**1. Clone this repository (or download the source code):**
```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/Study-Notes-Hub.git
cd Study-Notes-Hub
